{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-75ffd59c52cb8312ba11","statement":"Tthe polynomials $\\gamma_{mk}(l)$ for $m\\leq 4$ are listed below.\n\n\\begin{align*}\n\\gamma_{11}(l)=&l_{11}.\\\\\n\\gamma_{21}(l)=&(l_{21}+l_{22})+1.\\\\\n\\gamma_{22}(l)=&(l_{21}^{2}+l_{22}^{2})+(l_{21}+l_{22}).\\\\\n\\gamma_{31}(l)=&(l_{31}+l_{32}+l_{33})+3.\\\\\n\\gamma_{32}(l)=&(l_{31}^{2}+l_{32}^{2}+l_{33}^{2})+2(l_{31}+l_{32}+l_{33})+1.\\\\\n\\gamma_{33}(l)=&(l_{31}^{3}+l_{32}^{3}+l_{33}^{3})+4(l_{31}^{2}+l_{32}^{2}+l_{33}^{2})-(l_{31}l_{32}+l_{31}l_{33}+l_{32}l_{33})-6\\\\\n& +(l_{31}+l_{32}+l_{33}).\\\\\n\\gamma_{41}(l)=&(l_1 + l_2 + l_3 + l_4) + 6.\\\\\n\\gamma_{42}(l)=&(l_1^2 + l_2^2 + l_3^2 +l_4^2)+ 3(l_1+ l_2+ l_3+l_4) + 4.\\\\\n\\gamma_{43}(l)=& (l_1^3+ l_2^3 + l_3^3 + l_4^3)  -( l_1 l_2 +l_1 l_3 + l_1 l_4 + l_2 l_3 + l_2 l_4+l_3 l_4 ) +\\\\\n&+6 (l_1^2+l_2^2 + l_3^2 + l_4^2) + 3(l_1 + l_2+l_3+l_4)   - 19.\\\\\n\\gamma_{44}(l)=& (l_{1}^4+ l_2^4+ l_3^4+ l_4^4) + 9(l_{1}^3+ l_2^3 + l_3^3+ l_4^3)+ 21 (l_1^2+ l_2^2+ l_3^2+ l_4^2)-\\\\\n&( l_1^2 l_2 + l_1^2 l_3 + l_1^2 l_4  + l_1 l_2^2  + l_1 l_3^2 + l_1 l_4^2 + l_2^2 l_3 + l_2^2 l_4+ l_2 l_3^2  + l_2 l_4^2 + l_3^2 l_4+ l_3 l_4^2)\\\\\n&- 10 (l_1 l_2+ l_1 l_4+ l_2 l_3+ l_3 l_4+ l_1 l_3+ l_2 l_4) - 19(l_1+l_2+ l_3 + l_4) - 120.\n\\end{align*}","source_id":"arXiv:1812.07137","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"ef3c93e0ce9a5cc29f68b78415c2fcdeaed3649ffd3c0a49e33f508244b9bbfc","kind":"example","label":"Example 4","ref_key":"Example: explicit gamma's n leq 4","name":"","order":3,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07137","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"8f616d0dadfadd07368325eb5dcddec235c4bd760dc9d71a1a029bbeb9a88683","line":287,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:18:01+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":1165,"math_hints":119}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1812.07137","title":"Classification of simple Gelfand-Tsetlin modules of $\\displaystyle \\mathfrak{sl}(3)$","abstract":"We provide a classification and an explicit realization of all irreducible Gelfand-Tsetlin modules of the complex Lie algebra sl(3). The realization of these modules uses regular and derivative Gelfand-Tsetlin tableaux. In particular, we list all simple Gelfand-Tsetlin sl(3)-modules with infinite-dimensional weight spaces. Also, we express all simple Gelfand-Tsetlin sl(3)-modules as subquotionets of localized Gelfand-Tsetlin E_{21}-injective modules.","authors":["Vyacheslav Futorny","Dimitar Grantcharov","Luis Enrique Ramirez"],"year":"2018","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1812.07137","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"sm":"{\\mathsf m}","Ga":"{\\Gamma}","cD":"\\mathcal D","Stone":"\\fbox{\\makebox[11mm]{\\strut#1}}\\kern2pt"},"macros_override":["Stone","cD"]},"deps":[],"dependents":[]}